# Under the checking word Validate Link asks at its end, with the final facts, for everything that a lookup up the holders stood on: a name taken for unlaid, a holder taken for in sight, a member taken for a constant. Each still holds, or the node that the asker watches has been told; else the build stops by name (StaleFlowAssumption).
# Here the name is taken for unlaid first and the store is found later: the call is told and asks again, so nothing stops.
# OPTIONS: check=Validate
# LIBRARY: own
# PROGRAM-OF: name-added-to-a-holder-on-the-way-up-through-a-value-nobody-follows-is-not-taken-for-the-tables.ir
# RUN: link functions mechanisms=all
# CHECK-NOT: StaleFlowAssumption
# CHECK-NOT: function f2 unreached
